{
  "bodyHash": "CQsoQFvctBk=",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"Serilum 模組。用心製作。大量支援 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 的活躍模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p><h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"關於本模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">治療營火會在營火周圍建立一個區域，在可設定的半徑範圍內，玩家和/或被動生物會獲得回復效果。只要被動生物<em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">不</span> </em>屬於「<em>EntityClassification.Monster</em>」分類，模組化的被動實體也會獲得治療。當實體身上的回復效果剩餘一半持續時間，且仍靠近營火時，效果持續時間會重新整理。<br><br></span><strong><span style=\"color:#008000;font-size:16px\">1.16 版本的 <span style=\"color:#36f;font-size:16px\">靈魂營火</span>也相容！此功能可設定。</span></strong><br>您可能也會對 <span style=\"color:#f90\"><strong><a style=\"color:#f90\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/no-hostiles-around-campfire\" rel=\"nofollow\">營火周圍無敵對生物</a></strong></span> 感興趣。</p><h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"依賴項目\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective 模組\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"收錄於 The Vanilla Experience 整合包\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-rpg-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/rpg-bundle.svg\" alt=\"收錄於 Serilum's RPG Bundle 整合包\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg\" alt=\"環境：伺服器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可設定\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的設定選項：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>checkForCampfireDelayInTicks</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 40，最小值 1，最大值 1200</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">模組每隔多少刻檢查玩家周圍的營火。1 秒 = 20 刻，因此預設為每 2 秒檢查一次。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>healingRadius&nbsp;</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 16，最小值 1，最大值 64</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">營火周圍玩家獲得回復效果的半徑（以方塊計）。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>effectDurationSeconds</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 60，最小值 1，最大值 600</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">營火施加的回復效果持續時間。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>regenerationLevel</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 1，最小值 1，最大值 50</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">營火施加的回復效果等級，預設為 1。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>healPassiveMobs&nbsp;</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">啟用時，營火會治療周圍的被動生物，治療半徑為邊界框寬度的一半。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>hideEffectParticles&nbsp;</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">啟用時，隱藏營火周圍的回復效果粒子。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>campfireMustBeLit</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">啟用時，只有點燃的營火才會產生效果。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>campfireMustBeSignalling</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">啟用時，只有發出訊號的營火才會產生效果。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><em>僅限 1.16+ 版本的設定選項：</em></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableEffectForNormalCampfires</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">啟用時，模組將作用於普通營火。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableEffectForSoulCampfires</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">啟用時，模組將作用於靈魂營火。</span></p>\n</div><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">營火周圍的回復效果：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/healing-campfire/a.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>您可以在任何模組包中自由使用此模組，只要下載檔案仍託管於 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統內即可。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 包含所有可用模組的概覽和更多資訊。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">由於我無法在眾多獨立的模組頁面上追蹤留言，因此已停用留言功能。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>如有問題、想法、建議或其他事項，請至 <a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github 儲存庫</a>。謝謝！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
